      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please quote the Redfish specification where it says this is correct behavior.\n\nThe existing behavior (keeping properties available regardless of ServiceEnabled) is correct as far as I\u0027m aware.",
      "revId": "a2ffe3f211e7d2382f581514eeaad17fd228af78",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
